y shows but now they  do  even if you hated game of thrones you  cannot deny its success  impact or even influence on other shows  hbo now has a giant notch on their belt  and we can only hope they use all of  this new experience moving forward  i actually think they already have based  on some of the choices they've made  another thing that has me very excited  about house of the dragon is who hbo has  brought back from game of thrones  they have brought back their incredible  composer and best director  so if you're like me and you did love  the way game of thrones looked and  sounded  you will be very happy to know house of  the dragon should have a very similar  sound look and feel to the show it's  almost like hbo got rid of the worst  things about game of thrones like dan  and dave  and kept their best things from game of  thrones like miguel sapochnick  and rameen jawadi i'm assuming most of  you have already seen some of the  costumes as well  hbo has released a handful of official  images that show some of their main  actors and character  now i don't know about you but i think  they look amazing  obviously i'm no costume designer or  fashion expert but i love the way each  of these characters look  i know some of you do have some concerns  about the casting choices they've made  so far  but i have faith in hbo when it comes to  this specifically  at first glance you might think oh this  actor doesn't look right or this  actress's age isn't right for this  character and so on and so forth  however hbo did the same thing with game  of thrones  a lot of the characters from game of  thrones did not look like they would  have in the books  a lot of the actors in game of thrones  were different ages than their  characters from the books  yet hbo still did an amazing job i think  they do an amazing job in all of their  shows like game of thrones the wire  the sopranos deadwood oz the band of  brothers  and so many others who hbo hires as  their actors and actress